@startuml
title 两层 spec-driven 治理
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "Repository development" {
  artifact "openspec/specs" as ProductSpecs
  artifact "openspec/changes/<id>" as ProductChange
  ProductChange --> ProductSpecs : archive after implementation
}
package "Research workspace" {
  artifact "researchspec/specs" as ResearchSpecs
  artifact "researchspec/changes/<id>" as ResearchChange
  database "profiles + controls + handoffs" as Runtime
  ResearchChange --> ResearchSpecs : explicit edit after acceptance
  Runtime --> ResearchSpecs : reads stable facts
}
ProductSpecs ..> Runtime : defines product behavior
note bottom
  The two layers share current/proposed separation,
  but do not share lifecycle authority.
end note
@enduml
